sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant S as server.ts
    participant L as lifecycle.ts
    participant R as Redis (Lua)

    C->>S: join_queue {profile, preferences, intent}
    S->>S: rate limit (join_queue: 10/min)
    S->>S: moderate declared name — ANY flag refuses (D20/D35)
    S->>S: country := connection.country (never the client's)
    S->>L: joinQueue(sid, profile, prefs, intent)
    L->>R: setProfile — BEFORE queueing
    L->>R: preferenceAllowance — cooldown + hourly bucket
    alt granted
        L->>R: setPreferences
    else refused
        Note over L: degrade silently. NO frame. metric only.
    end
    L->>R: setIntent
    L->>R: joinQueue.lua — SADD queue, state=SEARCHING
    Note over R: caller is IN the SET before it scans (D4)
    loop up to MATCH_RETRY_ATTEMPTS = 3
        L->>R: tryMatch.lua
    end
    alt matched
        L->>R: readProfiles, readNicknames (BESIDE tryMatch, never inside)
        L->>L: retention.enqueue(conversation_started)  [P0]
        L->>R: saveMatchIdentities
        L->>R: mint presence tokens
        L-->>C: matched (this side, built in server.ts)
        L->>R: PUBLISH matched (other side, built in lifecycle.ts)
    else waiting
        S-->>C: queue_status SEARCHING
    end
